  "description": "<h1></h1>\r\n<h1>Fresh Frozen Spirulina</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-5 break-words text-base font-normal leading-normal text-slate-1150 md:mr-1\">\r\n<p>Our Spirulina is always fresh, never compromising on the nutrient-dense properties found within Spirulina. As the superfood that turns any smoothie into a &ldquo;green&rdquo; smoothie, Fresh Spirulina supercharges the nutrient profile while upping the vibrancy of your favorite smoothie recipe with its mild taste and creamy, smooth texture.</p>\r\n<p>Our Frozen Pods help create a satisfying consistency&mdash;like blending a frozen banana (but with far more nutrients). Plus, our fresh-freezing process keeps your Fresh Spirulina at its harvest peak quality, forever! Fresh Spirulina is free of all major food allergens. It is gluten-free, non-GMO, and vegan. And of course, we grow our Spirulina without pesticides or herbicides.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-[50px] md:mb-0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"mt-5 font-pop text-xl font-semibold leading-6.5 text-slate-1150\">Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Packed with nutrients, Spirulina is one the most nutrient-dense foods on earth</li>\r\n<li>No fishy flavor: fresh spirulina has a mild, neutral taste and a rich texture</li>\r\n<li>All nutrients are highly bioavailable, so your body can access vitamins quickly</li>\r\n<li>FDA-approved, HACCP &amp; ISO certified and 3rd party tested: 100% pure spirulina</li>\r\n<li>Packed with phytonutrients, chlorophyll + phycocyanin that fight cell damage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n</div>",
